  "description": "Arthur Groban, a new detective with the LAPD, is desperate to prove his ability despite being a rookie within the force. But with every case he is assigned, things look more and more bleak as the corruption in the shadows becomes ever more apparent. Feeling helpless, Arthur is almost ready to give up when he happens to cross paths with the mysterious and alluring Silas Moore. Silas is willing to pull some strings behind the scenes to help Arthur, so long as the detective gives him two things in exchange: his body, and his pride. The further Arthur goes for Silas, the more he will get in return. But how far is too far in the pursuit of justice? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Include 11 extra chapters.*",
